      "sequence_position": 10,
      "problem": "Find $x$, if $4a-2x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}12 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
